  "note": "P1: direction/origin. Gen endings pretaught in a1_gen_endings. do + Gen (to), z + Gen (from). ze sklepu/ze szkoły. Pisanie = w/do/z three-way choice (12). No Uzycie by design — sentences live in a1_motion (split 2026-08-02).",
